<title>FRANCE: PRESS DIGEST - Algeria - Nov 30.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Algeria - Nov 30.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Algerian press on Saturday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>AL CHAAB</p>
<p>- Algerians vote &quot;Yes&quot; for constitutional reforms.</p>
<p>EL MOUDJAHID</p>
<p>- Voters endorse a draft constitution.</p>
<p>L'AUTHENTIQUE</p>
<p>- Voters triumph over fear. More than 85 percent of the electorate say &quot;Yes&quot; for the constitution change.</p>
<p>LE MATIN</p>
<p>- Opposition parties reject the referendum and accuse government of rigging the vote.</p>
</text>
